    "body": "This is a feature I'd quite like to see added to the spec. I found it quite confusing to discover that 'toggle' and 'beforetoggle' events don't apply to all the same elements, with `<details>` being the only exception, and came here to raise it as a feature request myself before finding this issue already exists.\n\nAs someone new to interacting with the HTML spec, is there anything I can do to help this make progress?",
