    "body": "> [@keithamus](https://github.com/keithamus) can we say there's implementer interest for this in Firefox?\n\nYeah I think so - at least we're interested in solving the discrepency, but it seems like there's more here to unpack. We might want to start with https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10124 which may answer some questions here.",
