    "updated_at": "2026-02-19T09:32:44Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure what the equivalent spec mechanism for this is but WebKit has a \"finishParsingChildren\", I believe we could set a flag on the details element once this fires and conditionally fire the beforetoggle event based on that flag?\n\nOne other complexity is around cancelability when say details close based on the name attribute algorithm, do we want that close to be cancelable?",
