    "body": "I'm happy to implement this, however it gets solved.\n\nIf we can't make setAttribute or `details.open = true` fire a beforetoggle event, then I guess it would just be when the user clicks it or when calling `summary.click()`. If that's useful for people, then we could go ahead and do it.",
